      <informativeText>Suppress: 0x01 - Buzzer (Rx) 0x02 - LEDs (Rx / Tx) 0x04 - Status (Rx)  0x08 - Vibrator (Rx) 0x10 - Coded Phy (Tx)</informativeText>
